      "blurb": "The only surgeon who will put meat in you and not ask where it came from. Deals in marks, and only marks.",
      "publicNotes": "<p>There is no shop counter for bio-augmentation. There is the Butcher.</p><p>He works out of a room with a table, a knife and a recovery cot, and he keeps his own books. Prices are quoted in <strong>marks</strong> — hard coin, his own, off every Cyber City ledger. No rate to credits is posted anywhere and none is coming; what a mark is worth today is whatever he says it is.</p><p>He will buy back what he sold you. He will not pay what he charged.</p>",
